        <mj-text font-size="22px" line-height="30px" font-weight="300">Reset your password</mj-text>
        <mj-text>Hello {{name}}, someone asked to reset the password of your Generals Online account. If it was you, choose a new password here.</mj-text>
        <mj-button href="{{link}}" background-color="#f0b429" color="#1c1917" border-radius="2px" font-weight="500" align="left">Choose a new password</mj-button>
        <mj-text font-size="13px" color="#78716c">The link works for 1 hour and only once. If the button does not work, open this address: {{link}}. If you did not ask for this, your password stays as it is.</mj-text>
